	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_02b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２ねんまえの　ことだ
ドラゴンポケモンが　２ひき　めざめた▼
りそうを　もとめ　あらたなる
きぼうの　せかいに　みちびく▽
くろき　ドラゴンポケモン　ゼクロム▼
しんじつを　もとめ　あらたなる
ぜんの　せかいに　みちびく▽
しろき　ドラゴンポケモン　レシラム▼
ゼクロムと　レシラムは
もともと　１ひきの　ポケモンだった▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T12:38:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T08:08:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T12:38:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T08:08:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T08:10:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
シャガ</Text>
